WEBVTT

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.350
That's amazing.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:37.540
Wh-What the heck? There were 
still this many players left?

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:37.730
I can't believe he beat a boss like that.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:40.090
That guy has assets!

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.160
Want to join our team?

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.500
Hey, I think that's actually him.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.390
So annoying...

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:53.390
<b>The Door to Zero</b>

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:57.300
Suigin, everyone's talking about you.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:58.270
Let them talk.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:01.980
The only thing I care about right now 
is restoring my sealed memories.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.260
And...

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:06.630
Hey, what happens to 
you if your core is taken?

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:09.070
I don't need your sympathy.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:12.950
Since I was defeated, my job as 
a guardian will come to an end.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.280
As for how to use the core...

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.790
If you go with me to the entrance 
of Stage 0, you'll find out.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.610
There's something I want to ask you first.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:25.660
Why hasn't a single high-class 
player appeared before?

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.880
Other than Dark Tiger,

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.670
there aren't any powerful players 
participating in this crucial battle.

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.580
That's strange, isn't it?

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.680
If a praying mantis tries 
to capture a cicada,

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.580
there'll be a canary waiting behind it.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.680
So now would be the perfect time 
for someone to take my trophy.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.650
I'm impressed. You already noticed.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.920
It's just as you say.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:52.270
It's not that a high-class 
player didn't come.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:55.200
If you hadn't defeated me so quickly,

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.490
the one who would've been lying 
here would've been you.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.240
Huh? I don't get what you're saying.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:07.160
Does that mean some super powerful 
player is hiding somewhere?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.500
If my thoughts are correct,

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.070
then there's only one answer.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:15.430
They're off somewhere, killing.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:21.920
Exactly. The ten million class players 
are logging out one after another.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:26.010
Wait. Why would they all gather 
just to kill each other?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.400
Were they not interested in the boss?

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:32.800
That's not it. This is just the 
confidence of the powerful.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:36.810
To them, Aslan is an enemy that 
they can defeat at any time.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:41.790
Yeah, they were probably fighting each other 
to see who'd fight this stage's boss.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.040
And it wouldn't have really 
mattered who won.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:49.810
Which means that I'm lucky that 
I was able to defeat you.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.850
Or was this a trap set by someone?

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.930
Is there still some kind of event going on?

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.640
Out of the way!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:01.770
What?

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.220
Hey, these guys...

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.220
Those masks...

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.520
As you deduced, they're powerful.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:11.150
That's why I had to find you immediately.

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:17.160
If any of them had gotten to me first, 
I probably would've never met you.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:22.630
I see. So basically, the high-class 
players hate me now.

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:26.160
But first, let's deal with the core.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:31.020
Hurry and go to Stage 0. 
That is my final mission.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.910
Shut your mouth!

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:39.180
What kind of boss are you, 
letting a little brat like this beat you?

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:40.400
Who are you?

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.290
I'm Elder Baboon of Inbei.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.930
Hand over that boss's core 
if you don't want to die.

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:51.610
What? Inwei? Are you allowed 
to have such a dirty name?

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.110
I'm going to report you.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:55.320
Also, are you the only one here?

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.810
The rest of the members are here.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.990
How dare you talk to our elder like that?

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:05.210
This isn't good. Those are the 
famous thugs, the Silver Backs.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.130
Who are you calling thugs?

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:11.340
We're a reputable organization.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:16.790
Guys, let's show them our teamwork, 
strength and effectiveness!

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.010
Yeah!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:22.460
Yeah, they're definitely not the good guys.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:27.270
More importantly, could you move 
your foot? Aslan can't breathe.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.870
You can have that stupid mask back, brat.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:35.560
Don't get a swelled head just 
because you beat the boss.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.870
You won't even be able to stand when 
you find out who I really am.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:43.320
You should just do as you're told.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:49.740
Hey, cutie, it's a waste of time 
for you to be with that newbie.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:55.170
Why don't you join our team? 
I'll take special care of you...

00:05:56.450 --> 00:06:01.820
My ID is Ryuuman. Contact me 
anytime if you change your mind.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.950
Guys, proclaim our motto!

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:12.260
Tell them our rules of the game!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.710
Yes, sir!

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:17.560
Silver Backs! If you can't 
beat them, log out!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.980
Silver Backs! Retaliate against society!

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:26.180
Well? Terrifying, aren't we? 
Now, hurry up and hand over the core.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.300
I hate trash like you 
more than anything else.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.350
Farin, take care of Aslan.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:31.860
Okay!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.780
Aslan, you're even redder than 
usual and feel really hot.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:42.590
I guess I don't get to move 
forward until I fight that guy.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.580
Damn it. A surprise attack...

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.790
You coward.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.530
Whoops. I guess I missed.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.940
What's with that destructive power?

00:06:54.940 --> 00:07:00.960
Well, duh. I'll show you an 
even stronger attack next.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:03.070
Hey, look at that coin he has!

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.450
It's a one-million Shinryou coin!

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:08.410
He's going to strengthen his 
item with all that money?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.770
Wow... so you can strengthen 
your item with Shinryou coins?

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.670
Hey, you broke bastard!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:16.500
Broke? Are you talking to me?

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.970
You can't fool me!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.090
You're super poor!

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:23.730
The only way you were able to beat the 
boss was because you're just lucky.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.800
But you won't be that lucky again.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:27.930
All victories depend on your assets!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.640
You've probably never seen 
this before, have you?

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:33.100
This is a pillar of assets that only players

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:36.060
with a million or more can use, 
the Asset Graph!

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.690
Look at that long pillar of assets!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.070
I've never seen one that long!

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:45.860
Mine's this long because my 
assets exceed five million!

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:49.110
Huh... I don't think it's that long.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:51.410
Are you mocking me?!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:55.110
Hey, show this fool our Asset Graphs!

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:56.470
Yeah!

00:07:56.470 --> 00:08:00.270
Silver Backs! If you can't 
beat them, log out!

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:03.930
Silver Backs! Retaliate against society!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.390
Wow, that's the legendary...

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:07.900
All of them have over a million assets!

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.900
They're a super team.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:11.620
I didn't know they had so many 
million players in their squad...

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.500
Do you like comparing lengths?

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:14.150
Huh?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.310
That isn't all!

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:20.940
Our leader is so amazing that their 
assets exceeds a hundred million!

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:24.230
If you like doing this so much, 
I guess I'll give it try, too.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.390
Hey, how do you use an Asset Graph?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:32.690
You don't even know how to use one? 
Get off your high horse!

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:34.740
Hurry up and hand over the core!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.070
Asset Graph, appear.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.770
What the hell's up with those assets?!

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.420
Elder-san, we've never seen 
anything like that before!

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.930
Well? Do you still want to compare?

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:49.490
It's stupidly long!

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:54.300
Ten thousand, hundred thousand, a million, 
ten million, a hundred million, a billion...

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.960
That guy was a Billion Player?

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:00.130
No wonder he beat that boss in an instant!

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:03.180
Do you still want to take the core from me?

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:07.190
<i>To think that he was actually 
a Billion Player...</i>

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.960
Calm down! Keep your cool!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.900
Damn it. I guess I'm reporting to the boss.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.440
What's that?

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.370
Hey, that's enough fooling around.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.400
Stop wasting time.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:28.210
Evil Mirror, Evil Mirror.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.610
That's amazing.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:34.350
Suigin!

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.660
We arrived here in an instant.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.060
So this is the entrance to Stage 0.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:56.390
And we can now enter with the 
key that we got earlier.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:59.060
You're the only one that 
can enter from here.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.840
We can't enter Stage 0.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:02.930
Oh, really?

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:08.090
That's why you're going to have to see 
what lies beyond by yourself.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:11.220
Got it. You guys wait here.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:12.970
I'll go with you.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:15.820
Aslan, you can fly?

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.720
All right, I'm heading in.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.970
It's so quiet and white.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:52.260
Huh? This feels nostalgic for some reason.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.690
Riku Suigin, consume my core.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.570
You'll remember everything 
that happened here.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.930
My mission has come to an end.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.190
Okay, got it.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:11.830
What is this?!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.580
Gramps, there's a hole 
in the top of that tree.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.040
Yes, the ceremony is nearly over.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.880
Ceremony?

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:39.720
Damn it. My mask broke.

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:44.510
Who's calling me at a time like this?

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:49.590
Hello? I don't know who you are, but if 
you need something, spill it already.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:52.910
<i>You idiot. You don't even recognize my voice?</i>

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:57.120
Boss! I'm so sorry! 
Did you need something, sir?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.070
That's what I want to know.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.670
I just finished off the small fry,

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:04.370
but it seems that someone else 
defeated the guardian boss.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:08.040
Tell me, who took my quarry?

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:13.040
<b>A Reunion Through the Mirror</b>

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:18.710
<i>These are my memories?</i>

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.920
Hey, Gramps, who's that?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:28.440
She holds the same kind of 
power within her as we do.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:31.590
Her parents were killed by him...

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:37.550
But even that cannot stop the ceremony 
to offer her powers to this tomb.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.230
It should almost be complete.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:46.210
The tomb tree will completely 
absorb all of her powers.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:50.140
That power will become part of the 
power to protect this tomb,

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:53.800
and she will also forget about her past.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:59.130
She'll become a normal girl and be 
freed from her former chaotic fate.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:01.800
Hey, she fell.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.020
Suigin!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.510
Hey, are you okay?

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:17.690
Who are you?

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:21.440
I'm... I'm Suigin!

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.890
Suigin?

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.910
Yeah! Riku Suigin!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.250
What's your name?

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.960
Hey, she fell asleep again.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:39.420
Gramps, why did she fall asleep again?

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:42.340
She just lost all of her 
strength from the ceremony.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.810
Is she okay?

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.670
You don't need to worry, Suigin.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.770
It's your turn, next.

00:13:50.130 --> 00:13:51.400
Gramps?

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:53.490
I'm sorry, Suigin.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:58.430
But I have to take all necessary measures 
to ensure the enemy doesn't find you.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:13:59.360
Huh?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.820
As of now, you are no longer my grandson.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:12.010
These are my sealed memories?

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:13.200
That's right.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.720
He tried to protect you this way.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:23.970
He saved your memories and the 
information about Stage 0 within that fruit.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:29.360
Powers that lie within my ancient blood

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:31.310
heed my bidding.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:37.360
Use this fruit to protect the tomb 
and be born from a sea of blood.

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:42.620
On behalf of the 157th 
Grave Guardian Leader, Riku Yuuki.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:46.750
I will give you a new form and title.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.030
Aslan.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:59.630
Remember this... Those children 
will be our final trump card.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:02.320
Your mission, when the time comes,

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.070
is to reawaken Suigin's memories.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.710
Now do you remember who you really are?

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.230
Yeah... I remember everything.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:16.910
Very well. That means my mission is now over.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:17.890
Aslan.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.650
This is a gift for you.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:21.310
Huh?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.430
I bestow my powers unto you.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.210
This is...

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.940
Hey, look at all that money!

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:38.080
Everyone who survived the battle 
received the prize money!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.420
Lucky me! I'm glad I came!

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:43.180
I never thought I'd get 
so many Shinryou coins!

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:45.050
<i>Grave Buster</i> is awesome!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.960
My Seabay just received information 
that Aslan was defeated.

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.290
Suigin should be back soon.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.260
It's a little early to be so happy.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:58.430
Beating the boss first in the 
battlefield can sometimes backfire.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.190
What the hell's going on?

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:03.970
W-Well, we're sort of 
no match for this guy...

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:08.950
You didn't mention my assets or 
my connections with Precious?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:11.620
Well, this time...

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:12.610
<i>Spit it out.</i>

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:16.020
<i>He was a Billion Player!</i>

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:18.450
What? A Billion Player?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:22.550
B-Boss, please don't get emotional. 
I'll look into it a little more.

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.630
Hey, tell me where he is.

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.780
<i>Well...</i>

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:27.750
Hurry it up!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:33.730
R-Right! He's currently at the 
transfer entrance for Stage 0.

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:34.980
Got it.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.990
Elder-san, what's the boss planning to do?

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:42.740
Man, he's super pissed.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.520
I'm gonna go to the bathroom.

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.270
So what if he's a Billion Player?

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:52.150
I'll just end him with my Artemis Snipe.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.700
Map Cannon!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.200
What do you mean?

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:01.400
There are players that don't like other 
players beating the boss before them.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.230
Behind us.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:05.970
A very powerful energy is headed this way.

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:07.560
Hey, look over there.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.920
Something's shining.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:09.970
Is that a UFO?

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:11.080
A shooting star?

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.510
Must be fireworks to celebrate our win.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.620
That's not it at all.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:18.220
That must be super-long range, 
wide-area sniper shot.

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:20.640
And its power is...

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.240
immeasurable!

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:26.160
It's heading this way.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:33.290
Way to go, Boss! 
He used his god-killing shot!

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.160
That's his ultimate special 
move that he can use

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:39.020
if there are over a thousand 
players on this stage!

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:41.750
It's absolutely perfect for this situation!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.680
Crap. We let our guard down.

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:47.360
Stay back, you two.

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.300
That's crazy!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.510
They're not gonna make it out in one piece.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.890
Are you hurt?

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:03.470
Suigin?

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.450
Looks like you got yourself 
some nice equipment.

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:09.450
Yeah, and I figured out quite a bit.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:14.380
He's unharmed after that attack? 
That's impossible...

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.190
Hey, I'm back.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:20.780
Are you all right, Suigin? 
That was a really powerful attack.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:23.990
Yeah, I'm fine because of this equipment.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:27.530
Did you get this for defeating Aslan?

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.630
Yeah. The Bloody Armor.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:34.090
Apparently it also raises my HP.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.900
When it goes into effect,

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:41.750
my HP becomes the same as every other 
player on this level combined.

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:48.060
But that's amazing. That one hit 
took away a fifth of my HP.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:52.530
Don't get a big head. The one that's 
powerful is the one who shot that attack.

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:56.120
What a sight, what a sight.

00:18:57.260 --> 00:19:01.700
My phone? Hello? 
That took care of the trash, didn't it?

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:05.630
The god-killing shot didn't work?

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:08.600
Well, isn't that interesting. 
Very interesting.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.130
I'm heading over there.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:13.930
I haven't been this excited in a while.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.100
Let the murder spree begin.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.700
Can I have your contact info?

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.810
Help me level up!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.090
Be my friend!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.100
All of the players here...

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:27.170
were just used.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:31.280
The point of this battle was to lower 
all of the players' attack power.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:35.930
That makes it easier to take care 
of all the weaklings all at once.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:40.070
Riku Suigin, the festivities are over. 
Let's go see my boss.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.530
Wait. Let me know that 
Riku Rei is safe first.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:46.550
I want to talk to her directly this time.

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:48.480
Fine.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.590
I guess I'm feeling generous.

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:01.420
Riku Rei!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.760
Keep in mind that

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:06.540
she doesn't know about this 
battle or about Stage 0.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:09.340
Not telling her about 
them will keep her safe.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.280
Suigin?

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.220
Is that really you, Suigin?

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.240
Riku Rei... Thank goodness.

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.180
I'm sorry...

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:21.210
This whole situation is rather complicated 
and I can't really explain right now.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:26.630
Thank you. I know you'll come save me.

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:30.290
Yes, I promise. Just wait a little longer.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:35.730
Believe me... In a few days, 
everything will be back to normal.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.680
I do... I'll always believe in you.

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:43.680
I waited for you like this on the 
last day of <i>Dungeon Century</i>, too.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.650
And you came for me.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.570
I'll never let something 
like that happen again.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:21:00.910
I'll protect you for sure this time, 
and find the ones who killed your father.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:02.870
I'll be waiting.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:06.920
Look at my equipment. 
I'm no longer a no-charge meister!

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:08.840
See you soon.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.500
Suigin, I—

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:11.790
That's enough for now.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:18.810
Stage 0 will officially open in five days.

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:22.710
If that goes well, I'll hand 
you over to Riku Suigin.

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.190
But that's only if he manages 
to survive until then.

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:34.310
<b>Next Time
The Crazy Randengyoku / Billion Player</b>

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:32.180
The Silver Guardian!
